  "title": "Artist of the Week: of Montreal",
  "content": "<div id=\"attachment_7393\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-7393\" class=\"size-full wp-image-7393\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/of_montreal2_by_chad_kamenshine_600.jpg\" alt=\"Image: Chad Kamenshine\" width=\"600\" height=\"399\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/of_montreal2_by_chad_kamenshine_600.jpg 600w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/of_montreal2_by_chad_kamenshine_600-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/of_montreal2_by_chad_kamenshine_600-120x80.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /><p id=\"caption-attachment-7393\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Image: Chad Kamenshine</p></div>\n<div class=\"ContentRightInner t_mbgc t_qtc t_urtc\">\n<div id=\"inboxControl0fv-ReadMessageContainer\" class=\"v-ReadMessageContainer slideOnResize\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessage\" data-link=\"class{readMessageClass: ~tag.Show}\">\n<div id=\"ReadMessageScrollableSection\" class=\"rmMessages ClearBoth\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"readMessagePartControl247f\" class=\"c-ReadMessagePart ReadMsgContainer HasLayout ClearBoth HideShadows FullPart NoHistory Read RmIc\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.getHeaderCssClass(IsConversationPart, IsRead, IsDraft, IsTrustedSender, Items.length)}\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessagePartBody\" data-link=\"class{getClass:IsBodyExpanded}\">\n<div class=\"readMsgBody\">\n<div id=\"bodyreadMessagePartBodyControl252f\" class=\"ExternalClass MsgBodyContainer\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.cssClasses(PlainText, IsContentFiltered)}\">\n<div class=\"v-InboxFooterContainer\">\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>Who is That?</b></p>\n<div class=\"ContentRightInner t_mbgc t_qtc t_urtc\">\n<div id=\"inboxControl0fv-ReadMessageContainer\" class=\"v-ReadMessageContainer slideOnResize\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessage\" data-link=\"class{readMessageClass: ~tag.Show}\">\n<div id=\"ReadMessageScrollableSection\" class=\"rmMessages ClearBoth\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div id=\"readMessagePartControl247f\" class=\"c-ReadMessagePart ReadMsgContainer HasLayout ClearBoth HideShadows FullPart NoHistory Read RmIc\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.getHeaderCssClass(IsConversationPart, IsRead, IsDraft, IsTrustedSender, Items.length)}\">\n<div class=\"c-ReadMessagePartBody\" data-link=\"class{getClass:IsBodyExpanded}\">\n<div class=\"readMsgBody\">\n<div id=\"bodyreadMessagePartBodyControl252f\" class=\"ExternalClass MsgBodyContainer\" data-link=\"class{:~tag.cssClasses(PlainText, IsContentFiltered)}\">\n<div class=\"v-InboxFooterContainer\">\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">of Montreal are the mainstays of the alternative rock scene, the band originally forming in 1996 in Athens, Georgia and named after a failed romance between lead singer Kevin Barnes and a woman &#8216;of Montreal&#8217;. The band are famed for their live shows, combining the extroverted antics of Barnes with psychedelic light shows.</p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>What’s Their Sound?</b></p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">Through of Montreal&#8217;s thirteen-album, 20-year career their music has encompassed everything from gospel to afrobeat, funk and glam. Their music is an acquired taste, hinging upon Barnes&#8217; unique singing voice and a reluctance to confine themselves to the normalcy of mainstream rock music. While generally critically acclaimed, the band&#8217;s highpoint came with the release of album <em>Hissing Fauna, Are You the Destroyer</em> in 2007.</p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><strong>What Are They Up To?</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\">of Montreal&#8217;s latest album <em>Aureate Gloom</em> has been described by the band as &#8220;a golden despondency&#8221; and is said to be a return to the peak of <em>Hissing Fauna</em>. </p>\n<p class=\"ecxMsoNormal\"><b>Where Can I See Them?</b></p>\n<p>of Montreal are playing <a href=\"http://www.theklabristol.co.uk/live/472/of-montreal\" target=\"_blank\">Thekla on 24 April 2015</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"of Montreal - Empyrean Abattoir \" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0yqavWHco8A?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><b>Conal Dougan</b></p>\n<p></p>",
